%% @behavior B-PASS-ONE
% \codep@lblentity@active{label}{atom-key}
%   Populate the in-memory label->entity binding table from an
%   aux record.  Cross-run side; same-run populate happens
%   synchronously at \codep@recordlabelowner time.
