%% @behavior B-PASS-ONE
% \codep@entitymeta@active{key}{kind}{display}{print-kind}{parent-key}
%   Populate per-entity metadata csnames.  Four csnames for O(1)
%   field access (kind/display/print/parent).  \xdef (not \gdef)
